From a0ade28f6971ca976c73914410ae13676293a30d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jack Kingston <998656+jkingston@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 09:45:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(allwinner): add versioned A133 wake service

Add a default-off SiP service with distinct identity, version and
capability queries, plus raw-SPI wake calls over the reviewed SCP
transport.

Serialize runtime mailbox ownership and preserve the existing startup-only
binary when the service is disabled. Keep PSCI system suspend blocked.

